t("which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Sho ch'zun Eyal mor donuth, ik ranaheli donoth trun ze.'#{normal}#", "que no entiendes: #{italic}#'Sho ch'zun Eyal mor donuth, ik ranaheli donoth trun ze.'#{normal}#", "_t")
t("#{italic}#'In the beginning the world was dark, and the petty gods fought over their broken lands.'#{normal}#", "En el principio el mundo estaba oscuro, y los dioses pequeños lucharon por sus tierras rotas", "_t")
t("second mural painting", "segunda pintura mural", "_t")
t("third mural painting", "tercer mural pintura", "_t")
t("fourth mural painting", "cuarto mural", "_t")
t("which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg.'#{normal}#", "que no entiendes: #{italic} #Batialatoth ro Eyal, ik rinsi akan fronseth sumit kurameth ik linnet pora gasios aeren. Ach nen beswar goreg", "_t")
t("#{italic}#'We conquered the world, and built for ourselves towering cities of crystal and fortresses that travelled the skies. But some were not content...'#{normal}#", "#{italic} #Conquistamos el mundo, y construimos para nosotros ciudades imponentes de cristal y fortalezas que recorrían los cielos. Pero algunos no estaban contentos..", "_t")
t("fifth mural painting", "quinto mural", "_t")
t("which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Zubadon koref noch hesen, ik dorudon koref noch pasor. Cosief maro dondreth karatu - Ranaduzil - ik jein belsan ovrienis.'#{normal}#", "que no entiendes: #{italic} #Zubadon koref noch hesen, ik dorudon koref noch pasor. Cosief maro dondreth karatu - Ranaduzil - ik jein belsan ovrienis.'#{normal}#", "_t")
t("#{italic}#'Of pride we accepted no equals, and of greed we accepted no servitude. We made for ourselves terrible weapons - the Godslayers - and nine were chosen to wield them.'#{normal}#", "De orgullo no aceptamos iguales, y de codicia no aceptamos servidumbre. Hicimos para nosotros armas terribles - los Godslayers - y nueve fueron elegidos para limpiarlas. '# {normal}#", "_t")
t("sixth mural painting", "sexto mural", "_t")
t("which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Ranaheli meth dondruil ik duzin, ik leisif konru as neremin. Eyal matath bre sun. Ach unu rana soriton...'#{normal}#", "que no entiendes: #{italic}#'Ranaheli meth dondruil ik duzin, ik leisif konru as neremin. Eyal matath bre sun. Ach unu rana soriton..", "_t")
t("#{italic}#'The petty gods were hunted down and slain, and their spirits rent to nothing. The land became our own. But one god remained...'#{normal}#", "Los dioses pequeños fueron cazados y asesinados, y sus espíritus no alquilan nada. La tierra se convirtió en nuestra. Pero un dios se quedó..", "_t")
t("seventh mural painting", "séptimo mural", "_t")
t("which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Trobazan AMAKTHEL konruata as va aurin leas, ik mab peli zort akan hun, penetar dondeberoth.'#{normal}#", "que no entiendes: #{italic} #Trobazan AMAKTHEL konruata as va aurin leas, ik mab peli zort akan hun, penetar dondeberoth.'#{normal}#", "_t")
t("#{italic}#'The almighty AMAKTHEL was assaulted on his golden throne, and though many died before his feet, he was finally felled.'#{normal}#", "El poderoso AMAKTHEL fue agredido en su trono dorado, y aunque muchos murieron antes de sus pies, finalmente se cayó", "_t")
